<title>IRELAND: RUGBY UNION-AUSTRALIA BEAT CONNACHT 37-20 IN TOUR MATCH.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-AUSTRALIA BEAT CONNACHT 37-20 IN TOUR MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>GALWAY, Ireland 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat Connacht 37-20 (halftime 7-12) in their rugby union tour match on Wednesday. Scorers: Connacht - Try: Shane Leahy. Penalties: Eric Elwood (5). Australia - Tries: George Cregan 2, Tim Gavin, Owen Finegan, Alistair Murdoch. Conversion: Tim Wallace (3). Penalties: Wallace (2).</p>
</text>
